    [Documentation]
    ...              This KW will help to set CELL param on line
    ...              OAM request is done 1 time with a dictionnary created in a loop
    [Arguments]    ${param_value}   ${modiflist}
    ${dn}             set variable           MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}
    &{modify_param}   Create Dictionary
    ...                          parameter=btsName
